],"best_idea":"A single tired-body multiplier on attack, evasion, block and cast, fed by one fatigue ledger, plus a fatigue cost per swing and per block, gives a stamina economy that is one number in the engine.","decision":"adapt","decision_why":"Fatigue-as-multiplier and per-swing cost fit the Frankendom stamina economy and can be server-computed; adapt because the code is GPL-3.0 (shape only) and defects D1 (overshoot dropped) and D2 (roll unit mix) must be fixed, and the sleep-regen path is not needed yet.","decision_status":"proposed","acceptance":"With skill 50, Agi 40, Luck 30 and evasion 10 a player lands about 66 of 100 swings at full stamina and about 36 at empty; a server test asserts round(61 x 0.75 - 10) = 36 and round(61 x 1.25 - 10) = 66, and a 0.2 use gain that crosses 1.0 keeps 0.2 of progress."}
